<rml>
<head>
<title>Таблица</title>
<link type="text/rcss" href="../kit.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="gallery">
<div class="g-page">
<div class="g-title">C-Table</div>
<div class="g-note">На всю ширину экрана: колонки сохраняют ширину, растёт гибкая (1fr)</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 100%; height: 280dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-wide" head="1" fade="0"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Трюм","w":"56px","align":"right"},{"label":"Склад","w":"56px","align":"right"},{"label":"Цена","w":"84px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Ядра","icon":"ammo","sub":"пачка 20"},"200","0",{"text":"5","delta":{"from":"5","to":"8"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Сахар","icon":"sack","tag":"demand"},"0","38",{"text":"52","tone":"gold","bold":true}],"selected":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Шёлк","icon":"chest","tag":"contract","badge":"seal"},"12","4",{"text":"190","delta":{"to":"190"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Табак","icon":"leaf","badge":"bolt","tag":{"text":"редкость","tone":"hi"}},"7","0",{"text":"110","tone":"danger"}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Бомбы","icon":"bomb","badge":"lock"},"0","0","14"],"disabled":true,"reason":"нужен перк «Бомбардир»","showReason":true}]'/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">Строки: выбранная, метка на значке, недоступная (причина — тостом); стрелки 44 dp; more = 6</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 520dp; height: 300dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-goods" more="6"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"У вас","w":"140px","align":"center"},{"label":"Цена","w":"70px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Ядра","icon":"ammo","tag":"export"},{"text":"200","arrows":true},{"text":"5","delta":{"to":"4"}}],"selected":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Картечь","icon":"grape","badge":"check"},{"text":"100","arrows":true},"6"]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Бомбы","icon":"bomb","badge":"lock"},{"text":"0","tone":"dim","arrows":true,"noLeft":true},"14"],"disabled":true,"reason":"нужен перк «Бомбардир»"},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Порох","icon":"powder","tag":"contraband"},{"text":"40","arrows":true},"9"]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Ром","icon":"rum","tag":"import"},{"text":"60","arrows":true},"12"]}]'/></div>
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 520dp; height: 280dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-head" head="1" fade="0"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Трюм","w":"56px","align":"right"},{"label":"Склад","w":"56px","align":"right"},{"label":"Цена","w":"84px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Ядра","icon":"ammo","sub":"пачка 20"},"200","0",{"text":"5","delta":{"from":"5","to":"8"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Сахар","icon":"sack","tag":"demand"},"0","38",{"text":"52","tone":"gold","bold":true}],"selected":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Шёлк","icon":"chest","tag":"contract","badge":"seal"},"12","4",{"text":"190","delta":{"to":"190"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Табак","icon":"leaf","badge":"bolt","tag":{"text":"редкость","tone":"hi"}},"7","0",{"text":"110","tone":"danger"}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Бомбы","icon":"bomb","badge":"lock"},"0","0","14"],"disabled":true,"reason":"нужен перк «Бомбардир»","showReason":true}]'/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">Пусто (empty + emptyIcon) · выбор (preset picker: путь, «подходит», кнопка внизу) · image: портрет, жетон, предмет; флаг, полоса, caps</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 220dp; height: 250dp; padding: 0"><c-table columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"}]' rows='[]' empty="Склад пуст" empty-icon="store"/></div>
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 280dp; height: 250dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-picker" preset="picker" path="Сен-Пьер › Верфь › Орудия" fade="0"
    columns='[{"label":"Орудие","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Цена","w":"64px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Кулеврины 12 ф.","icon":"cannon"},"1 200"],"fit":true,"selected":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Пушки 16 ф.","icon":"cannon"},"1 800"],"fit":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Пушки 24 ф.","icon":"cannon"},"3 400"],"disabled":true,"reason":"слишком тяжёлые для люггера"}]'
    primary='{"label":"Установить","sub":"−1 200"}'/></div>
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 340dp; height: 250dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-mixed" head="1" caps="1" fade="0" row-height="52"
    columns='[{"label":"Кто","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Нация","w":"48px","align":"center"},{"label":"Опыт","w":"110px"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Тичингиту","sub":"абордажник","image":{"kind":"portrait","texture":"INTERFACES/PORTRAITS/128/face_205"},"imageSize":40},{"flag":"france"},{"text":"840 / 1000","bar":84}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Лонгвэй","sub":"штурман","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"hero","enamel":"teal"}},{"flag":"holland"},{"text":"120 / 1000","bar":12}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Пистоль","sub":"оружие","image":{"kind":"item","texture":"INTERFACES/items6","cell":8,"icon":"pistol"}},{"icon":"lock","iconOnly":true,"iconTone":"dim"},{"text":"—","tone":"dim"}]}]'/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">На пергаменте: только чтение (interactive=false, строки 40), с заголовком; и интерактивная</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-paper" style="width: 330dp; height: 250dp; padding: 0"><c-table surface="parchment" interactive="0" fade="0"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Цена","w":"70px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Сахар","icon":"sack","tag":"export"},{"text":"38","delta":{"to":"52"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Кофе","icon":"sack","tag":"import"},"74"]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Табак","icon":"leaf","tag":"contraband"},{"text":"110","delta":{"to":"90"}}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Шёлк","icon":"chest","tag":"demand"},"190"]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Письмо губернатора Тортуги о награде за голову капитана и о сроках выплаты","icon":"scroll","lines":2},"—"]}]'/></div>
  <div class="g-paper" style="width: 380dp; height: 250dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-paper" surface="parchment" head="1" more="3"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"У вас","w":"140px","align":"center"},{"label":"Цена","w":"60px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Ядра","icon":"ammo","badge":"check"},{"text":"200","arrows":true},{"text":"5","tone":"gold"}],"selected":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Бомбы","icon":"bomb","badge":"lock"},{"text":"0","arrows":true,"noLeft":true},"14"],"disabled":true,"reason":"нужен перк «Бомбардир»","showReason":true},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Порох","icon":"powder","tag":{"text":"новое","tone":"ok"}},{"text":"40","arrows":true,"noRight":true},{"text":"0"}]},
           {"cells":[{"text":"Ром","icon":"rum","sub":"бочки"},{"text":"60","arrows":true},{"text":"12","tone":"danger"}]}]'/></div>
  <div class="g-paper" style="width: 170dp; height: 190dp; padding: 0"><c-table surface="parchment" columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"}]' rows='[]' empty="Записей нет" empty-icon="journal"/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">Выбранная строка прокручивается вместе со списком (не закрепляется)</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 300dp; height: 180dp; padding: 0"><c-table id="tbl-scroll" fade="0"
    columns='[{"label":"Товар","w":"1fr"},{"label":"Цена","w":"64px","align":"right"}]'
    rows='[{"cells":[{"text":"Сахар","icon":"sack"},"52"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Кофе","icon":"sack"},"74"],"selected":true},{"cells":[{"text":"Табак","icon":"sack"},"110"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Шёлк","icon":"sack"},"190"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Ром","icon":"sack"},"12"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Порох","icon":"sack"},"9"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Доски","icon":"sack"},"8"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Парусина","icon":"sack"},"11"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Ядра","icon":"sack"},"5"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Картечь","icon":"sack"},"6"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Бомбы","icon":"sack"},"14"]},{"cells":[{"text":"Вино","icon":"sack"},"30"]}]'/></div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
